1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
Ikki yigit, ikkalasi ham yigirma yoshda.

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:06,950
Biri amaldagi jahon chempioni, ikkinchisi
Toshkentda tug‘ilgan da’vogar.

3
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:11,890
Shaxmat tarixida jahon chempionligi uchun hech
qachon bunday yosh raqiblar to‘qnashmagan.

4
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:15,980
Hozir esa Jenevada butun O‘zbekiston
kuzatib turgan bahs ketmoqda.

5
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:20,470
Javohir Sindarov jahon chempioni tojiga
hech qachon bunchalik yaqin bo‘lmagan.

6
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,690
Ikki partiya o‘tdi, hisob teng.

7
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:29,730
Xo‘sh, bu ikki partiyada aslida nima bo‘ldi va nega ko‘plab
mutaxassislar aynan o‘zbek shaxmatchisini favorit deb hisoblamoqda?

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,490
Avval, asosiy faktlar.

9
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:38,540
Shaxmat bo‘yicha jahon chempionati o‘yini 24-noyabrda Shveysariyaning
Jeneva shahri yaqinidagi Kolonyi shaharchasida boshlandi.

10
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:41,230
Mezbon — Martin Bodmer jamg‘armasi binosi.

11
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:45,060
Bir tomonda — jahon chempioni,
hindistonlik Gukesh Dommaraju.

12
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:48,360
Ikkinchi tomonda — o‘zbekistonlik
grossmeyster Javohir Sindarov.

13
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:51,940
Qoidalar oddiy: jami 14 ta
klassik partiya o‘ynaladi.

14
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:55,760
Birinchi bo‘lib yetti yarim ochko to‘plagan
o‘yinchi jahon chempioni bo‘ladi.

15
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:59,960
Agar hisob yetti — yetti bo‘lib qolsa, g‘olib tezkor
shaxmatdagi qo‘shimcha partiyalarda aniqlanadi.

16
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,350
Mukofot jamg‘armasi — 2,5 million dollar.

17
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:06,640
Har bir g‘alaba uchun o‘yinchiga
qo‘shimcha 200 ming dollar beriladi.

18
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:08,440
Endi birinchi partiyaga qaytamiz.

19
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:10,880
Seshanba kuni Sindarov oq
donalar bilan o‘ynadi.

20
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:14,360
Gukesh mudofaada ishonchli hisoblangan
Berlin himoyasini tanladi.

21
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:16,190
Lekin partiya tinch kechmadi.

22
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,800
Bosimni Sindarov ushlab turdi.

23
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:22,620
Gukesh esa murakkab pozitsiyalarda uzoq
o‘ylanishga majbur bo‘ldi va vaqti tanqis qoldi.

24
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:28,100
Xalqaro shaxmat nashrlari bu partiyani “Gukesh
Berlindagi xavfdan omon qoldi” deb sarlavha qildi.

25
00:01:28,140 --> 00:01:29,960
Partiya 38-yurishda,

26
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,180
pozitsiya uch marta takrorlangani
sababli durang bilan yakunlandi.

27
00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:34,960
Chorshanba kuni ikkinchi partiya bo‘ldi.

28
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,920
Bu safar oq donalar Gukeshda edi.

29
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:40,920
U London tizimi deb ataladigan
nisbatan sokin debyutni tanladi.

30
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:44,110
Partiya bor-yo‘g‘i yigirma
yurishda yana durang bilan tugadi.

31
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:47,920
O‘yindan keyin Gukesh debyut tayyorgarligida
xatoga yo‘l qo‘yganini tan oldi.

32
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:50,780
Demak, ikki partiyadan
keyin hisob bir — bir.

33
00:01:50,820 --> 00:01:55,430
Bugun esa uchinchi partiya o‘ynalmoqda
va unda oq donalar yana Sindarovda.

34
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:57,830
Sindarov bu darajaga qanday yetib keldi?

35
00:01:58,020 --> 00:01:59,740
Javohir 2005-yil

36
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:01,660
8-dekabrda Toshkentda tug‘ilgan.

37
00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:04,630
Shaxmatni unga bobosi
Komil Sindarov o‘rgatgan.

38
00:02:04,780 --> 00:02:08,640
U 12 yosh 10 oyligida
grossmeyster unvonini oldi.

39
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:11,990
Bu o‘sha paytda tarixdagi
ikkinchi eng yosh natija edi.

40
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:16,840
O‘zbekiston terma jamoasi tarkibida u ikki
marta Shaxmat olimpiadasi g‘olibi bo‘lgan:

41
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:21,290
2022-yilda Chennayda va
2026-yilda Samarqandda.

42
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:24,310
Asosiy burilish esa so‘nggi
bir yilda yuz berdi.

43
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:28,020
2025-yilda Hindistonning Goa
shtatida o‘tgan Jahon kubogida

44
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:31,060
Sindarov ro‘yxatda atigi
16-o‘rinda turgan edi.

45
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:37,410
Lekin finalda xitoylik Vey Ini yengib, turnir tarixidagi
eng yosh va ilk o‘zbekistonlik g‘olibga aylandi.

46
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:40,630
Bu g‘alaba unga Da’vogarlar
turniriga yo‘l ochdi.

47
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:46,560
2026-yil bahorida Kiprda o‘tgan bu turnirda
u 14 partiyadan 10 ochko to‘pladi:

48
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:49,890
6 g‘alaba, 8 durang va
birorta ham mag‘lubiyat yo‘q.

49
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:53,050
Turnirning ushbu formatidagi
eng yuqori natija shu.

50
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:56,050
G‘alabani esa bir tur
qolganida qo‘lga kiritdi.

51
00:02:56,380 --> 00:02:58,970
Endi bu bahs nega bunchalik
muhim? Qisqacha tushuntiramiz.

52
00:02:59,020 --> 00:03:00,790
Birinchidan, kuchlar nisbati.

53
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:03,370
Sindarovning reytingi — 2782.

54
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,390
U dunyo bo‘yicha to‘rtinchi o‘rinda.

55
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:09,600
Gukeshning reytingi esa bu yil
sezilarli pasayib, 2700 atrofida.

56
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:13,240
Ya’ni chempion reyting bo‘yicha
da’vogardan ancha pastda turibdi.

57
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:16,510
Bu jahon chempionatlari
tarixida kam uchraydigan holat.

58
00:03:16,660 --> 00:03:18,630
Ikkinchidan, o‘zaro uchrashuvlar.

59
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:21,540
Ular klassik shaxmatda ilgari
uch marta to‘qnashgan.

60
00:03:21,580 --> 00:03:23,590
Sindarov ikki marta g‘alaba qozongan,

61
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:25,100
bir partiya durang bo‘lgan.

62
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:28,190
Gukesh esa Sindarovni klassik
partiyada hali bir marta ham yutmagan.

63
00:03:28,980 --> 00:03:30,960
Uchinchidan, mutaxassislar fikri.

64
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:36,810
Sobiq jahon chempioni Magnus Karlsen Sindarovni
bu bahsda ancha aniq favorit deb atagan.

65
00:03:36,980 --> 00:03:39,020
Sindarovning o‘zi esa ehtiyotkor.

66
00:03:39,060 --> 00:03:42,660
O‘yindan oldin u imkoniyatlarini
ellikka ellik deb baholagan.

67
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:45,920
Lekin Gukeshni hech kim yengil
raqib deb o‘ylamasligi kerak.

68
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:50,840
U 2024-yilda Singapurda xitoylik Ding Liren
bilan bo‘lgan o‘yinda g‘alaba qozonib,

69
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:55,150
18 yoshida tarixdagi eng yosh
mutlaq jahon chempioni bo‘lgan.

70
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:57,880
O‘sha o‘yinda ham u ko‘pchilik
kutmagan paytda natijani

71
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:01,160
o‘z foydasiga burgan edi.
Jenevada Gukesh shunday degan:

72
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:03,640
“Men biror narsani himoya
qilish uchun kelmadim.

73
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:06,410
Men hammasini yana qaytadan
yutish uchun keldim”.

74
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:09,340
O‘zbekiston uchun bu shunchaki
sport natijasi emas.

75
00:04:09,380 --> 00:04:13,100
2004-yilda Rustam Qosimjonov FIDE
jahon chempioni bo‘lgan edi.

76
00:04:13,140 --> 00:04:16,760
Ammo o‘sha paytda shaxmat olamida ikki
xil chempionlik unvoni mavjud edi.

77
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,520
Agar Sindarov g‘alaba qozonsa,

78
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:22,040
u O‘zbekistondan chiqqan birinchi
mutlaq jahon chempioni bo‘ladi.

79
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:26,400
Bu o‘yin butun mamlakatda minglab bolalarning
shaxmatga qiziqishini uyg‘otib yuborishi mumkin.

80
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:29,560
Endi eng muhim savol:
bundan keyin nima bo‘ladi?

81
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,670
Hali 12 partiya oldinda.

82
00:04:31,780 --> 00:04:33,340
Bugungi uchinchi partiyadan keyin

83
00:04:33,380 --> 00:04:36,560
27-noyabr — o‘yinning
birinchi dam olish kuni.

84
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:39,580
So‘ng har uch partiyadan keyin
bir kunlik tanaffus bo‘ladi.

85
00:04:39,620 --> 00:04:41,880
O‘yin 12-dekabrgacha davom etadi.

86
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:44,060
Agar g‘olib klassik
partiyalarda aniqlanmasa,

87
00:04:44,100 --> 00:04:47,110
o‘sha kuni tezkor shaxmatda
qo‘shimcha partiyalar o‘ynaladi.

88
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:51,410
Bir qiziq tafsilot ham bor. Javohir
8-dekabrda 21 yoshga to‘ladi.

89
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:54,180
Taqvimga ko‘ra, o‘sha kuni
12-partiya o‘ynalishi kerak.

90
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:56,400
Ehtimol, aynan shu kunlarda taqdirni

91
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:59,640
hal qiluvchi partiyalar bo‘lib o‘tadi.
Lekin bir narsani unutmaslik kerak.

92
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:02,940
Reyting va mutaxassislar bashorati
g‘alabani kafolatlamaydi.

93
00:05:02,980 --> 00:05:05,720
Jahon chempionati o‘yinlari
ko‘pincha bitta xato yoki

94
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:08,020
bitta kutilmagan debyut bilan hal bo‘ladi.

95
00:05:08,060 --> 00:05:09,980
Hozircha ma’lum bo‘lgan yagona fakt —

96
00:05:10,020 --> 00:05:12,790
hisob teng va kurash endi boshlandi.

97
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:15,960
Xulosa shuki, ikki partiya
natijasi teng bo‘lsa-da,

98
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:20,610
birinchi zarbani Sindarov berdi. Chempion
bosim ostida himoyalanishga majbur bo‘ldi.

99
00:05:20,660 --> 00:05:23,980
Gukesh esa o‘z tayyorgarligidagi
kamchilikni o‘zi tan oldi.

100
00:05:24,020 --> 00:05:25,480
Keyingi ikki hafta ichida

101
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:29,280
O‘zbekiston tarixidagi eng katta sport
g‘alabalaridan biri yozilishi mumkin.

102
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:33,440
Yoki tajribali chempion yana bir bor
hammani hayratda qoldirishi mumkin.

103
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:37,700
Sizningcha, Javohir Sindarov o‘n to‘rt
partiyaning o‘zidayoq g‘alaba qozonadimi?

104
00:05:37,740 --> 00:05:40,390
Yoki taqdir tezkor
shaxmatda hal bo‘ladimi?

105
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:45,320
Fikringizni izohlarda yozing. Bahsning har
bir partiyasini kuzatishda davom etamiz.

